              Viral Short-Form Edit
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#5e5377] mt-0.5">
              High-retention pace, sound-synced cuts, and trending visual hooks.
            </p>
            <span class="inline-block mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-purple-200">
